  "html": "<p>Express 或 Fastify 在项目规模扩大后，真正让人头疼的往往是各层代码互相直接 <code>new</code> 依赖、模块边界模糊、测试替身无从切入。NestJS 在底层 HTTP 适配器（默认 Express，可切换 Fastify）之上提供了一套强约束的应用结构：用 Module 划定功能边界与可见性，用 IoC/DI 容器托管对象创建与生命周期，用 TypeScript 装饰器与反射元数据声明路由和注入点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层链路与核心依赖组成\">分层链路与核心依赖组成</h2>\n<p>NestJS 将单次 HTTP 请求拆成职责单一的处理链路，Controller 只管 HTTP 协议边界，业务编排进 Service，持久化封装进 Repository：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"text\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP Request</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Middleware        原始请求预处理、Cookie、请求 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Guard             身份认证与权限元数据校验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Interceptor       进入控制器前后的横切增强（日志、响应包装）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Pipe              参数类型转换与 DTO 运行时校验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Controller        匹配路由、读取输入、返回结果或领域映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Service           执行业务规则与事务编排</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Repository        读写数据库或外部存储</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span></code></pre>\n<p>手动搭建最小 NestJS 应用至少依赖五个核心包：<code>@nestjs/core</code> 提供 <code>NestFactory</code> 启动逻辑，<code>@nestjs/common</code> 提供 <code>Module</code>、<code>Controller</code>、<code>Injectable</code> 与各类装饰器，<code>@nestjs/platform-express</code> 对接底层 Express 实例，<code>reflect-metadata</code> 让运行时能够读取装饰器元数据，<code>typescript</code> 负责将代码编译为目标 JavaScript。</p>\n<p>入口文件 <code>main.ts</code> 从根模块启动应用：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"ts\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/main.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { NestFactory } </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@nestjs/core'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { AppModule } </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './app.module'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bootstrap</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NestFactory.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(AppModule);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">listen</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(process.env.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">PORT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ??</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3000</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bootstrap</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><code>NestFactory.create(AppModule)</code> 会以根模块为起点递归扫描全部导入模块，实例化 Provider 并构建依赖图，再将所有 Controller 方法注册到底层 HTTP 路由表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"控制反转ioc与-di-容器机制\">控制反转（IoC）与 DI 容器机制</h2>\n<p>如果在业务类内部直接实例化下游依赖，<code>OrderService</code> 就被彻底锁死在具体实现上，换数据库或写单元测试时必须改动业务源码：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"ts\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 紧耦合：创建权与使用权混在一起</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderService</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> repository</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FileOrderRepository</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 控制反转：只通过构造函数声明契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderService</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> repository</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderRepository</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>控制反转（IoC）把依赖的实例化控制权从业务类移交给外部容器，依赖注入（DI）则由容器在启动阶段自动解析并注入所需实例。</strong></p>\n<p>在 NestJS 中启用标准构造函数注入需要同时满足三个条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>被注入的服务类必须标注 <code>@Injectable()</code>。</li>\n<li>该服务必须登记在当前模块的 <code>providers</code> 中，或由某个已导入的模块在 <code>exports</code> 中显式导出。</li>\n<li>使用方在构造函数参数里声明对应的类或注入 Token。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre data-language=\"ts\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// messages/messages.service.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Injectable } </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@nestjs/common'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MessagesRepository } </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './messages.repository'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Injectable</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MessagesService</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</sp